WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.450
Introducing. The Shopping Agent on Your Side.

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:06.950
Monday, 11:40 at night. Your shop is closed. Shoppers' agents aren't. Hearth Roasters opens at 8. Tonight, requests from shoppers' agents will arrive while you sleep. Who answers them?

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.450
Publish your terms once. House blend coffee, 1 kilo, $34, 120 in stock. Ships Monday to Friday, 30-day returns, readable by shoppers' agents.

4
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:19.450
Set the rules. Your agent keeps them. Quote $34 a bag, no deeper discounts. Hold 20 bags for regular customers. Offer the 250 gram pack as a swap, with the shopper's yes. Send wholesale asks to you. Anything outside your rules waits for you.

5
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:25.950
Overnight, requests arrive. 11:52: a regular customer's weekly refill, 1 kilo: fits your terms. 1:15: 1 kilo at 25% off: outside your price band. 3:30: a gift bag by Friday: fits, the courier can make it. No personal details until an order is placed.

6
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.450
Fits your terms? It becomes an order. Order HR-1190: house blend, 1 kilo, $34, weekly refill, paid in your own checkout. Her weekly limit came with it, and so did your terms: 30-day returns, ships Tuesday.

7
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:35.950
Doesn't fit? Nothing is offered. 1 kilo at 25% off is below your $34 price: declined, and nothing was offered. Discounts stay your decision.

8
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:41.950
Tuesday, 8:02. Good morning. Here's your night: 2 orders on your terms, $68, in your checkout. 1 discount ask declined, nothing offered. 1 for you: wholesale, 40 bags for a café.

9
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.950
Your store. Your sale. You are the seller: the order is placed in your store. Your checkout: your payment provider takes the payment. Your courier, your returns: service under your own policy.

10
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:52.450
An authorised reseller? Agents can see it. Orrin conical grinder, $139, from Spoke & Chain, authorised by Orrin; the brand warranty applies. The brand's authorisation is attached to every Orrin offer you publish. A seller it couldn't check is shown as exactly that.

11
00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:59.950
Repeat orders that come back to you. Discount asks answered by your price band. Authorised status shoppers' agents can see. Dated orders, only when you can make the date.

12
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.450
Safe, Fast, Fun!

13
00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:06.450
The Shopping Agent on Your Side. Join Now.
